+- Upstream fix (21.1.24): https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/xserver/-/commit/d6d96084f305a142eb3db7f720d7edd21e4c98b4
+- Commit that introduced the vulnerable ordering: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/xserver/-/commit/4781f2a5a8c2c2b000374e2d87982a6701d5a6b3
